(7673383, 1253409, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  It''s very inviting and the light and tones are just right.  For me it''s not only about physical corners in the sense of angles, but about that use of the word "corner" to mean a small area, generally kind of secluded - like a cozy corner where I draw away from the world to read and reflect and which doesn''t have to be <u>in</u> a physical corner at all.  Got a 9 from me and I''m glad to see it in the top five.</td>', 'I love this one.  It''s very inviting and the light and tones are just right.  For me it''s not only about physical corners in the sense of angles, but about that use of the word "corner" to mean a small area, generally kind of secluded - like a cozy corner where I draw away from the world to read and reflect and which doesn''t have to be in a physical corner at all.  Got a 9 from me and I''m glad to see it in the top five.', '2020-08-28 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
